PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement
Vendor Name: "Chipkin Automation Systems"
Product Name: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ASC"
Product Model Number: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ASC"
Product Description: "A BACnet/IP Application Specific Controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents three read-only sensor objects (Analog Input, Binary Input, Multi-State Input) and three commandable output objects (Analog Output, Binary Output, Multi-State Output), answers ReadProperty for every required property of every object, accepts WriteProperty to the commandable outputs' Present_Value (refusing values out of range) and acts on the winning command through a simulated valve, relay and drive whose feedback the input objects report, reports a disconnected valve through Analog Output 1's Reliability and Status_Flags FAULT, announces itself with an I-Am heartbeat that DeviceCommunicationControl silences and resumes, and is discoverable by Who-Is / I-Am and Who-Has / I-Have. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-ASC profile."

BACnet Standardized Device Profiles Supported:
{
B-ASC - BACnet Application Specific Controller
}

BIBBs Supported:
{
DS-RP-B
DS-WP-B
DM-DDB-B
DM-DOB-B
DM-DCC-B
}

BACnet Standard Application Services Supported:
{
ReadProperty Execute
WriteProperty Execute
DeviceCommunicationControl Execute
IAm Initiate
IHave Initiate
WhoHas Execute
WhoIs Execute
}

Standard Object Types Supported:
{
Analog Input
Analog Output
Binary Input
Binary Output
Device
Multi-state Input
Multi-state Output
Network Port
}

Data Link Layer Option:
{
BACnet IP, (Annex J)
}

Character Sets Supported:
{
ISO 10646 (UTF-8) / ANSI X3.4
}

Special Functionality:
{
Maximum APDU size in octets: 1476
Segmented Requests Supported, window size: 1
Segmented Responses Supported, window size: 1
}

Default Property Value Restrictions:
{
unsigned-integer: <minimum: 0; maximum: 65535>
signed-integer: <minimum: -2147483648; maximum: 2147483647>
real: <minimum: -3.4e+38; maximum: 3.4e+38; resolution: 0.01>
character-string: <maximum length string: 64>
octet-string: <maximum length string: 256>
list: <maximum length list: 10>
}

Fail Times:
{
Notification Fail Time: 60
Internal Processing Fail Time: 2
Minimum ON/OFF Time: 2
Schedule Evaluation Fail Time: 2
External Command Fail Time: 5
Program Object State Change Fail Time: 5
Acknowledgement Fail Time: 2
Slave Proxy Confirm Interval: 6
Unconfirmed Response Fail Time: 4
Activate Changes Fail Time: 30
Auto Negotiation Fail Time: 15
Foreign Device Registration Fail Time: 10
Channel Write Fail Time: 30
}

